        <div class="container">
            <h2>Our Mission & Vision</h2>
            <p><strong>Mission:</strong> To deliver reliable and affordable products that enrich the lives of our community.</p>
            <p><strong>Vision:</strong> To become the most trusted trading partner by promoting sustainability and supporting local vendors.</p>
